# Copy to frontend/.env. Never commit frontend/.env.
#
# Leave this unset to run without accounts: no sign-in screen, and the backend
# treats every request as the single local user. Set it and the app requires a
# real Clerk account -- the backend must have CLERK_ISSUER set to match.
#
# From https://dashboard.clerk.com -> your app -> API Keys -> Publishable key.
# This key is public by design; it ships in the browser bundle.
# VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
